==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Triumphant|Machamp|26}} from the {{TCG|Triumphant}} expansion.
*'''Knocking Hammer''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Pangoro|174}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

